  _subtitle: The road to the Emerald City
  _description: Leads from the [[d4610800-66f9-4cd3-a263-8147f1a76207|Munchkin Village]]
    to the [[9d4c77c2-5244-4449-b2ef-0ed428ada08e|Emerald City]], past the [[e40fea6d-99ae-4dd4-8af1-1f7cbd1dd3eb|Scarecrow's
    Cornfield]] and through the [[aff1ca7b-f460-47b0-a9c9-988afb3b57a5|Tin Woodman's
    Forest]].
